<b>VAT RETURN PERIOD 10/2026 — DEFERRED FILING WINDOW.</b>
Registration <b>455-312-889</b> (non-established taxable person, Amazon EU marketplace fulfiled) has been
granted a deferred filing window for period 10/2026 pending reconciliation of marketplace-collected VAT.
<b>The window closes on the 7th of next month</b> — returns and supporting records not received by then
move to automated penalty assessment (default surcharge framework), and the registration is flagged for
online marketplace reporting under the joint-liability rules.
</p>

